      "content": "Clean. All four changes are in:\n\n- **Palette** — secondary text bumped from `#6b7a6c` to `#a0c0a2` (sage-green, much more legible), card backgrounds from `#0b1a0d` to `#0e2010` for better contrast, borders from `#1a2e1c` to `#243e26`. Descriptions and log entries are now clearly readable.\n\n- **Energy** — max raised to 20, starting with 18. Regenerates 1 per 5 minutes. The pip row is gone — replaced with a compact fill bar + `18/20 ⚡` label that color-shifts green → yellow → orange as energy drops.\n\n- **Outpost auto-refresh** — shop stock refreshes automatically every 5 minutes. A live `0:00` countdown shows in the header. Manual refresh button removed.\n\n- **Sell tab** — Outpost now has FOR SALE / SELL GEAR tabs at the top. The sell tab shows every inventory item (including consumables) with its sell price and a sell button. Tab label shows count of sellable items.",
